        LowOwn s2 ⟨lab, o⟩ tw → OverT E s2 ⟨lab, o⟩ tw → WinGU E s2 lab o tw →
        ∃ y ∈ RS, y.1 = lab ∧ CrCov y.2.2 o :=
  pieceAcctF0DC (cr₁ := cr) (hcle := fun _ _ => Res.le_refl _) hC hsto hf hown hlay hnoT hcpl hniU hclo hat hus hone hiniW hinR htyc hvq hVq hlq hLq hvn hVn hln hmem2 hsub2 hFl hFm hFj hpr2 hcm hlP hP0 hwB hW2 hW3 hGnd hGit hGcov
