    ⟨Tot, H', C, F, cr', db', Gd, fun _ => .zero, ThInvMCFSQK.toRS (hV r hr) (hF r hr hpa hq) (hR r hr hpa hq) hnp h1, h2, h3, h4, le_plh0 h5, h6⟩⟩
