      hsto hat hg hini (hvR _ _) hfr hle hE he htv' hm hH hC
      (by simpa [offs_zero] using hni x rel a v (some tk) e hterm _ pw ⟨lab, 0⟩ _ _ [.one] 0 hea (by simp [addrOf, hpw]) rfl hus (by simp [nWords, Acc.size])) hRPc
