/-- (KeepPl) `tstepMCF_stepTS` keeping the credits `KeepPl`: the new credits `cr'`
satisfy `PromCrK` (plant credits kept, `dropA`) and, off `publish`, keep every old or
key-free plant credit and lie below `cr`. -/
theorem tstepMCF_stepTSA {p : Prog} {g : G} {mem : Memory} {pairs : List Ts} {th : TTh}
    {cx : Cx} {ρ : Nat → Nat} {η : TEnv} {Rf Rs H : Res} {cr db : Ts → Res}
